              "instruction": "“he sees us two” — saḥ āvām paśyati",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: “he sees us two” — *saḥ āvām paśyati*]"
            }
          ]
        },
